---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
  title="About KDS Airdrop Hub"
  description="Learn about KDS Airdrop Hub, its editorial approach, and the purpose of its crypto airdrop guides."
  canonical="https://airdrop-hub.cryptoatlas.workers.dev/about"
>
  <main>
    <section class="article">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="article-header">
          <span class="coming-soon-badge">About</span>
          <h1>About KDS Airdrop Hub</h1>
          <p class="article-meta">
            By Krisna Dwi Saputra · Reviewed for the 2026 season
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="article-body">
          <h2>What is KDS Airdrop Hub?</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub is an educational website focused on crypto
            airdrops, testnets, faucets, quests, and practical wallet safety.
          </p>

          <p>
            The goal is simple: make it easier for beginners to understand
            how airdrop opportunities work while recognizing the risks that
            come with interacting with unfamiliar crypto projects.
          </p>

          <h2>Our Approach</h2>
          <p>
            The site focuses on educational guides rather than promises of
            profit. Topics are explained in straightforward language, with
            attention to common risks such as fake websites, malicious
            transactions, phishing, wallet-draining attempts, and unrealistic
            reward claims.
          </p>

          <p>
            Crypto opportunities can change quickly. A campaign that exists
            today may close, change its requirements, or become unavailable
            later. Readers should always verify current information through
            the official channels of the project they are considering.
          </p>

          <h2>Editorial Responsibility</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub aims to keep its guides useful, understandable,
            and appropriately cautious. Content may be reviewed and updated
            as the broader crypto ecosystem changes.
          </p>

          <p>
            Examples used on this website may be illustrative rather than
            live opportunities. Readers should not treat an example as an
            endorsement of a particular project.
          </p>

          <h2>About the Author</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub is created and maintained by
            <strong>Krisna Dwi Saputra</strong>.
          </p>

          <h2>Important Note</h2>
          <p>
            KDS Airdrop Hub is an educational resource. Nothing on this
            website should be considered financial, investment, tax, or legal
            advice. Always do your own research and consider the risks before
            interacting with crypto assets or blockchain applications.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</MainLayout>
